{"kind":"decision","text":"ADR-0046 amends ADR-0033 section B. PO: ESCALATE opens a pm-question item, which the program manager resolves with --by pm. PO: SCOPE-CHANGE opens a client-only scope-change item. While either is open, only the asking crew stops BLOCKED (\"awaiting program manager:\" or \"awaiting client:\"). A resumed stage re-reads the item through factory inbox, never with a timer. PO: DECIDE still never waits.","source":"plugins/truss/workflows/stage.js:1032-1101, plugins/truss/bin/inbox.ts:18-19","target":"plugins/truss/docs/adr/0046-crew-decisions-reach-pm.md","task":"adr-0046","member":"crew-decisions-writer"}
