{"kind":"feature","text":"stage.js admit() forwards factory admit's 'awaiting client: <id>' for any open blocking inbox item, including pm-question, so a fix-step hold on a PM question reads as a client wait; holdStop's program-manager wording is only on the pendingCall task path.","source":"plugins/truss/workflows/stage.js:423-440,1156","task":"stress","member":"crew-decisions-tester-6"}
